<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Navakholo TerraHub Initiative | NTI</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;1,600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #030303;
            color: #d1d5db;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .header {
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            background-color: #030303;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .logo-img {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 1px solid #d4af37;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-right: 12px;
        }

        .brand-text h2 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin: 0 0 2px 0;
        }

        .brand-text p {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: #9ca3af;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .content-container {
            max-width: 580px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex: 1;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            color: #f3e5ab;
            font-size: 1.85rem;
            line-height: 1.3;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .description {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #9ca3af;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 100%;
            height: 1px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .founder-title {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .founder-name {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #f3f4f6;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .btn-explore {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4e50, #f9d423);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 78, 80, 0.4);
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-explore:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <!-- Jaribu kutumia picha moja kwa moja kutoka kwenye public, kama bado itaendelea, unaweza kubadilisha source kuwa URL ya moja kwa moja ya GitHub Raw -->
        <img src="/nti.jpg" alt="NTI Logo" class="logo-img" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terrahubinitiative-sys/nti.com/main/public/nti.jpg';">
        <div class="brand-text">
            <h2>NAVAKHOLO TERRAHUB</h2>
            <p>Execution Over Excuses • Skills Over Papers</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-container">
        <h1>The Radical Economic Revolution of NTI</h1>
        
        <p class="description">
            Welcome to the official archival repository and knowledge base of the Navakholo TerraHub Initiative. Engineered from the ground up to dismantle hardware barriers, empower rural youth through mobile smartphone terminals, and establish a decentralized financial powerhouse across Kenya and beyond.
        </p>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="founder-title">Architect & Founder</div>
        <div class="founder-name">Ezra Wanyama (THE SMARTPHONE SCIENTIST) — NTI-ETL01</div>

        <a href="/home" class="btn-explore">ENTER TO EXPLORE</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
